- decimal/exact: 49.

Probe B (integrity: SoD CHECKs, the guards mth_app cannot disable, raw-SQL races) passes 16/16 twice. Probe D (inheritedApproval: read-only, read gate, acyclic, additive) passes 5/5 twice.

The advisory-lock registry has 730219–730223 as five distinct classes; the extra 730222 match is a historical comment.

Migrations 0020–0027 are present and unchanged since round 3.

Contract: 270 operationIds; P2_PENDING_KPI, P2_PENDING_BACKEND and all seven p3-pending-*.ts lists are empty; the coverage and 429 sweeps pass.

My round-1 observation on the DG2-approved product-gate submit and decide routes is unchanged and not raised.

